WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.414 --> 00:00:04.004
Unit fourteen. Digital Photo Albums!

2
00:00:04.943 --> 00:00:10.699
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.749 --> 00:00:14.237
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.287 --> 00:00:18.730
Today we learn about Digital Photo Albums. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.918
Photo album. Say it with me. Photo album!

6
00:00:27.448 --> 00:00:32.104
Organize. Say it with me. Organize!

7
00:00:35.547 --> 00:00:39.099
Folder. Say it with me. Folder!

8
00:00:42.598 --> 00:00:46.498
Collection. Say it with me. Collection!

9
00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:53.881
Memory. Say it with me. Memory!

10
00:00:57.413 --> 00:01:02.010
Browse. Say it with me. Browse!

11
00:01:05.506 --> 00:01:09.430
Digital. Say it with me. Digital!

12
00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:16.780
Gallery. Say it with me. Gallery!

13
00:01:20.281 --> 00:01:28.327
A digital photo album organizes my pictures into a collection. I can browse my gallery to look back at memories.

14
00:01:28.377 --> 00:01:31.686
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:32.415 --> 00:01:37.837
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:37.887 --> 00:01:39.037
Folder!

17
00:01:39.955 --> 00:01:45.342
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.392 --> 00:01:46.542
Digital!

19
00:01:47.525 --> 00:01:55.799
Did you know? Digital photo albums can hold thousands of pictures, far more than an old paper photo album could!

20
00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:58.282
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:59.115 --> 00:02:08.757
Think and answer. What is a favorite memory you might save in a photo album?

22
00:02:08.807 --> 00:02:10.004
Great answer!

23
00:02:11.001 --> 00:02:16.883
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:16.933 --> 00:02:20.122
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

